@host = https://localhost:7043
@deviceId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@apiCredential = replace-with-monitoring-read-credential

### Private host records and collection gaps, ordered by platform receipt time.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/host-logs?from=2026-11-01T00%3A00%3A00Z&until=2026-11-02T00%3A00%3A00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{apiCredential}}
